      "role": "user",
      "content": "a private release... i dont even know if that's possible anymore. it feels like i'm just stuck in this loop where the only thing that changes is that things get slightly worse. everything is so heavy and loud and then so incredibly quiet and empty. i just want the noise to stop. i just want to be able to rest properly, without feeling like i'm failing or waiting for something terrible to happen. i just want peace.",
